From e02d76b121a2fe0c78695abf1387b3e7c5948c6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Andrei V. Lepikhov" <lepihov@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:53:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH v0 2/3] Unpack short numerics on the stack in the remaining
 functions

---
 src/backend/utils/adt/numeric.c | 136 +++++++++++++++++---------------
 1 file changed, 74 insertions(+), 62 deletions(-)

